  <section aria-labelledby="minimal-about">
    <h2 id="minimal-about">About</h2>
    <p>Hi, I’m Lee. I live in Atlanta, by way of the DC area. I’m interested in how we might work together better to solve hard problems.</p>
    <p>I do research, strategy and design work through GOODNEIGHBOR, LLC. My training is in social science. Most of my work so far has been in public health and global health ethics.</p>
    <p>For useful references and rabbit holes, see <a href="/shelf/">Stacks</a>. Updated irregularly.</p>
  </section>

